	.string "You bought a DONUT at the AMERICAN\n"
	.string "BAKERY earlier, didn't you?\l"
	.string "Sounds delicious!\p"
	.string "It's probably gone cold by now.\n"
	.string "Perhaps you could warm it up?$"


